  "body": "## Summary\n\nStage-3 cleanup of the commit-SHA image migration: removes the now-dead `ci-pr`/`ci-ref` run-scoped lookup tag emission from `docker-build-check`.\n\nGlimmung's deploy-image resolver was re-keyed to resolve CI images by the commit-addressed `sha-\u003ccommit\u003e` alias ([romaine-life/glimmung#873](https://github.com/romaine-life/glimmung/pull/873), merged + deployed). The `sha-\u003ccommit\u003e` alias is published by the step this PR keeps; the run-scoped `ci-*` lookup tag is no longer read by anything, so its emission is removed.\n\nEnd state: `docker-build-check` publishes only the `sha-\u003ccommit\u003e` alias.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
